    "name": "IMPOSSIBLE ROOMS: No Way Out",
    "steam_appid": 3730520,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730520/extras/2c475470024ac36430e76c606031a1f2.poster.avif?t=1748205395\" width=800 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730520/extras/2c475470024ac36430e76c606031a1f2.webm?t=1748205395\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730520/extras/2c475470024ac36430e76c606031a1f2.mp4?t=1748205395\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cooperative Puzzle Adventure in Extreme Situations</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive together into a world full of deadly rooms where every decision matters. From lethal traps to clever mechanisms \u2013 only through communication and team spirit can you solve the puzzles and reach the exit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730520/extras/031f5a350fb10c86670a0f565be13e15.poster.avif?t=1748205395\" width=800 height=526 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730520/extras/031f5a350fb10c86670a0f565be13e15.webm?t=1748205395\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730520/extras/031f5a350fb10c86670a0f565be13e15.mp4?t=1748205395\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Eight Rooms \u2013 Eight Rules. No Repeats.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each room presents new challenges: shifting rules, unpredictable mechanics, and completely different ways of thinking. You won\u2019t experience the same thing twice \u2013 every level forces you to adopt new tactics and collaborate quickly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730520/extras/d666ff97c3c845809d3d6a2b8313a91a.poster.avif?t=1748205395\" width=800 height=526 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730520/extras/d666ff97c3c845809d3d6a2b8313a91a.webm?t=1748205395\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730520/extras/d666ff97c3c845809d3d6a2b8313a91a.mp4?t=1748205395\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Timing, Logic, and Trust Are the Key</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Being smart isn\u2019t enough \u2013 you must act at the right moment. Coordinated movements, shared clues, and perfect synchronization decide between success and collective failure. Observe, discuss, act.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730520/extras/2707639e69f9d54d80eb175b207fc1fd.poster.avif?t=1748205395\" width=800 height=526 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730520/extras/2707639e69f9d54d80eb175b207fc1fd.webm?t=1748205395\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730520/extras/2707639e69f9d54d80eb175b207fc1fd.mp4?t=1748205395\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unforgiving but Fair \u2013 Hardcore for Real Teams</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;IMPOSSIBLE ROOMS&quot; forgives no mistakes. Those who want to beat the challenge must be ready to fail \u2013 over and over again. But each failure teaches you something, and every retry sharpens your strategy. Only true teams make it through all rooms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730520/extras/e0914b86cc91b9280c08be18e4c01c8f.poster.avif?t=1748205395\" width=800 height=526 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730520/extras/e0914b86cc91b9280c08be18e4c01c8f.webm?t=1748205395\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730520/extras/e0914b86cc91b9280c08be18e4c01c8f.mp4?t=1748205395\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Atmosphere Meets Minimalism: Less Is Deadly</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clean level design and focused audiovisual cues create tension without distraction. No HUDs, no unnecessary clutter \u2013 just you, your team, and the rooms that want to destroy you. The focus is on your mind and your connection.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730520/extras/2c475470024ac36430e76c606031a1f2.poster.avif?t=1748205395\" width=800 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730520/extras/2c475470024ac36430e76c606031a1f2.webm?t=1748205395\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730520/extras/2c475470024ac36430e76c606031a1f2.mp4?t=1748205395\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cooperative Puzzle Adventure in Extreme Situations</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive together into a world full of deadly rooms where every decision matters. From lethal traps to clever mechanisms \u2013 only through communication and team spirit can you solve the puzzles and reach the exit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730520/extras/031f5a350fb10c86670a0f565be13e15.poster.avif?t=1748205395\" width=800 height=526 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730520/extras/031f5a350fb10c86670a0f565be13e15.webm?t=1748205395\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730520/extras/031f5a350fb10c86670a0f565be13e15.mp4?t=1748205395\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Eight Rooms \u2013 Eight Rules. No Repeats.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each room presents new challenges: shifting rules, unpredictable mechanics, and completely different ways of thinking. You won\u2019t experience the same thing twice \u2013 every level forces you to adopt new tactics and collaborate quickly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730520/extras/d666ff97c3c845809d3d6a2b8313a91a.poster.avif?t=1748205395\" width=800 height=526 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730520/extras/d666ff97c3c845809d3d6a2b8313a91a.webm?t=1748205395\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730520/extras/d666ff97c3c845809d3d6a2b8313a91a.mp4?t=1748205395\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Timing, Logic, and Trust Are the Key</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Being smart isn\u2019t enough \u2013 you must act at the right moment. Coordinated movements, shared clues, and perfect synchronization decide between success and collective failure. Observe, discuss, act.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730520/extras/2707639e69f9d54d80eb175b207fc1fd.poster.avif?t=1748205395\" width=800 height=526 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730520/extras/2707639e69f9d54d80eb175b207fc1fd.webm?t=1748205395\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730520/extras/2707639e69f9d54d80eb175b207fc1fd.mp4?t=1748205395\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unforgiving but Fair \u2013 Hardcore for Real Teams</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;IMPOSSIBLE ROOMS&quot; forgives no mistakes. Those who want to beat the challenge must be ready to fail \u2013 over and over again. But each failure teaches you something, and every retry sharpens your strategy. Only true teams make it through all rooms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730520/extras/e0914b86cc91b9280c08be18e4c01c8f.poster.avif?t=1748205395\" width=800 height=526 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730520/extras/e0914b86cc91b9280c08be18e4c01c8f.webm?t=1748205395\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730520/extras/e0914b86cc91b9280c08be18e4c01c8f.mp4?t=1748205395\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Atmosphere Meets Minimalism: Less Is Deadly</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clean level design and focused audiovisual cues create tension without distraction. No HUDs, no unnecessary clutter \u2013 just you, your team, and the rooms that want to destroy you. The focus is on your mind and your connection.</p>",
